{"id":"595957","name":"莲藕猪肉馅饺子","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/595957/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莲藕","amount":"1块"},{"name":"猪肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"毛葱","amount":"2个"},{"name":"火龙果","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材。","img":"images/595957/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"面粉加入火龙果汁和匀。","img":"images/595957/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"和成面团盖保鲜膜醒30分钟。","img":"images/595957/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"莲藕、毛葱、葱一起用料理机搅碎。","img":"images/595957/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"猪肉馅中放入所有调料，油需烧开再浇上更入味，拌匀。","img":"images/595957/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入莲藕碎。","img":"images/595957/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/595957/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切剂子。","img":"images/595957/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包馅。","img":"images/595957/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"水开下水煮约7分钟。","img":"images/595957/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盛出。","img":"images/595957/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}